    'Technical programme authoring, taxonomy, versions and rollback, and stored-value controls stay separate from everyday Grow setup.':'Pengarangan teknikal, taksonomi, versi dan pemulihan, serta kawalan nilai tersimpan kekal berasingan daripada persediaan harian Grow.',
